**Priority:** P0 — Customer UX Correction

**Execution Mode:** VERIFY SOURCE → AUDIT MENU & BUSINESS FLOWS → CONSOLIDATE DUPLICATE UX → SIMPLIFY DOCUMENT UPLOAD → TEST → REPORT

**Implementation Authorization:** YES — Targeted Frontend and Necessary Backend Contract Corrections

