# 2. CONFIRMED SCHOOL AUTHORITY MODEL

The current School Reviewer is already the authorized person responsible for finalizing the School's proposed application list.

The reviewer is NOT required to complete an additional per-Student recommendation approval workflow after preliminary review.

The intended process is:

**REVIEW APPLICATIONS → SELECT STUDENTS → ATTACH ONE PDF → FORWARD TO CITY.**

When selecting applications for official forwarding, the authorized reviewer expresses the School's recommendation intent.

Any separate backend recommendation records necessary for the canonical model should be reconciled through the authorized finalization process, subject to actual business constraints.

Do not require an additional mandatory "Đánh giá đề xuất" step for every Student.

Do not automatically mark unselected Students as failing or not recommended.

Do not automatically select applications merely because all five criteria pass.

