The School Reviewer should have three clear working areas:

**TỔNG QUAN** — Understand operational progress.

**HỒ SƠ SƠ TUYỂN** — Review applications and handle supplementation.

**DANH SÁCH ĐỀ NGHỊ** — Select Students, attach the official PDF and forward once.

