Do not make reviewers retype document metadata.

Do not make reviewers manage technical lifecycle states.

Do not make reviewers approve the same Student twice.

**LEAN-4.2 SUCCESS = ONE CLEAR MENU STRUCTURE + ONE REVIEW WORKSPACE + ONE SELECTABLE FORWARDING LIST + ONE PDF + ONE CONFIRMATION.**

